CRM,2017,salesforce.com/company/about-us,ok,"Create deeper relationships with your customers using the world’s first CRM solution that’s available with Einstein AI — it uses your Salesforce data to constantly get smarter, making you more productive and your customers happier.
Now anyone can be a Customer Trailblazer who transforms their company — and grows their career — using our easy-to-use, yet powerful, technologies and tools.
In Hawaiian culture, “Ohana” means family; it's the tie that binds people together. Our Ohana is built on four core values that inspire us to work together every day toward improving the world.
Founded in 1999, Salesforce pioneered the revolutionary idea of replacing traditional desktop CRM software with CRM in the cloud, making it accessible anytime from anywhere. Today, our innovative cloud platform is the world’s #1 CRM solution.
Everyday, more than 150,000 companies just like yours are increasing employee productivity, team collaboration, customer loyalty and, most importantly, their sales using the world’s #1 CRM platform.
Our innovative cloud-based platform gets accolades from press around the world, but it’s the dedication to helping our customers succeed that's made us the world’s 4th-largest software company.",1219,trafilatura,ok
