Our values | DE&I | Leadership I Patients
Our values
We hold ourselves to the highest standards of ethics and integrity.
We're driven by a desire to improve life
Our values represent the core of our character and guide every decision and action we take.
- Patients first
- Respect for people
- Ethics and integrity
- Innovation and scientific excellence
Diversity, equity and inclusion
We recognize the importance of embedding a culture of inclusion and belonging at every level of our company. We’re committed to fostering an environment of engagement, equity and empowerment.
We strive to provide equal opportunity for all
A DE&I mindset is central to our business growth and enables us to ensure patients and customers experience ultimate health outcomes.
Leadership
Our leaders guide our purpose to use the power of leading-edge science to save and improve lives around the world. This is the foundation of everything we do.
The team that guides our passion
Our leaders come from all areas of the business to help position us to succeed.
Patients and caregivers
We work hard to bring you the medications and vaccines that help fight some of the world's most serious health concerns.
