HAL,2016,halliburton.com/en-us/about-us/default.page,ok,"With over 55,000 employees, representing 140 nationalities in approximately 70 countries, Halliburton is one of the world’s largest providers of products and services to the global energy industry. The Company has corporate headquarters in Houston, Texas, and Dubai, United Arab Emirates.
Halliburton serves the upstream oil and natural gas industry throughout the life cycle of the reservoir – from locating hydrocarbons and managing geological data, to drilling and formation evaluation, well construction and completion, and optimizing production throughout the life of the field.",583,trafilatura,ok
